  m_text: To progress to the next floor, you must traverse the dungeon until you
    find the exit. Walk into the exit to move to the next level. The equipment upgrades
    you found in the current floor will persist into the next floor. To assist in
    your search to the exit, you have a map and a compass. The map shows the area
    around you and the compass points towards the exit, although the direction being
    indicated by the compass does not reflect the actual path to the exit.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
